(4,'d4123a760a93',2,'Prevention and screening','Screening an asymptomatic person to detect disease early is usually classified as which level of prevention?','Secondary prevention',['Primary prevention','Tertiary prevention','Palliative care'],'Secondary prevention aims to detect and treat disease early, before it progresses or causes substantial harm.'),
