(4,'c5570fa3b7dd',2,'Family planning','Which contraceptive method also reduces the risk of many sexually transmitted infections when used correctly?','Condoms',['Combined oral contraceptive pills','A contraceptive implant','An intrauterine device'],'Condoms provide a barrier that reduces pregnancy risk and transmission of many infections. Hormonal contraception and IUDs do not provide STI protection.'),
