(4,'ed2df575d4b9',1,'Ethics and professionalism','What does accountability require of a physician?','Taking responsibility for professional actions',['Avoiding disclosure of errors','Delegating all decisions to patients','Prioritizing personal income'],'Accountability means accepting responsibility for actions, decisions and professional standards.'),
